Ency., 2 ed., 874, 876. Bank holding draft for collection has no authority to sell: 75 Am. Dec., 137; 55 Mich., 357; 1 Wall., 166. Ozwier may pursue property or sue for proceeds: 60 S. C., 107. As to ratification: 1 Ency., 2 ed., 1195, 1199, 1187, 1189. Agent is liable to principal for difference betzoeen price at zuhich he sold and at which he could have sold: 67 S. C., 468; Story on Law of Sales, sec. 98.\nOctober 17, 1905."}, "file_name": "0458-01", "first_page_order": 470, "last_page_order": 477}